text Each of my footsteps feels heavy.
text I wonder what I am walking down this path for.
text Where am I going...?
text Having blended into the crowd of students wearing the same uniform, I am aimlessly walking in the same direction.
text Step by step, I get closer and closer to school. At the same time, my mood is souring bit by bit.
text The closer I get to school, the higher the chance I run into them.
text When I walk into the classroom, it is certain that I will run into Ryou.
text I don't know what to say to her.
text I'm sure I won't be able to speak when I see her teary face...
text And if she smiles at me... I wouldn't be able to say a thing either.
text I'm so pathetic...
text I come to realize that as I walk.
text The distance between each of my steps are much shorter than usual...
