text During class...
text There is the teacher's voice, and the voice of my classmate answering questions after being called on...
text While I listen to those voices, I lay down on my arm in my usual napping position.
text When I close my eyes, I finally feel sleepy.
text Thanks to the noise in the background, the ringing that I hear in my ear at night is now easier to bear.
text But...
text When Ryou delivers her answer after being called on...
text When her voice reaches my ear...
text My hazy consciousness is forcibly awakened...
text With my forehead still buried in my arms, and without changing my posture, I open my eyelids.
text As I stare at the wooden texture of my desk in the dimly lit environment below my head and arms, I hear her voice...
text I bet even if I fell asleep... that'll wake me right up...
text It's painful...
text No matter what she is actually saying now, her voice sounds as if she is reproaching me.
text I know that there is no way Ryou would do something like that...
text Even so, the sense of guilt in me is driving me to think that way...
text I have discovered how much of a weakling I am; it almost shocked me...
