text I wonder how many times I have come to these places...
text I wonder how many times I have gone up and down these stairs...
text When I see a girl with a similar hairstyle as her, I chase after them.
text I keep glancing through the windows in the hallways and classrooms.
text I am searching for Ryou...
text While I reminisce about the memories we had made together...
text ...Her smile begins to appear in my mind.
text Then her flushing red face when she's embarrassed...
text Her serious face when she's telling fortunes...
text Lastly... her sorrowful, heartbroken face...
